{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Dialogue data for Captain Harrow (Militia Leader). Seasonal/daily pool + heart milestones.",
    "version": "1.0",
    "objective": "#33 Complete NPC Dialogue"
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_001",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Engineer. Eastern perimeter's quiet. Stay sharp.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_002",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "weather": "RAIN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Rain keeps the raiders indoors too. Small mercies.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_003",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Spring means longer days. Longer days mean more patrol time. Good.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_004",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Hot. Militia's on half-rations of water. Fix that pump, engineer.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_005",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "weather": "RAIN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Wet powder doesn't fire. Check the turret housing seals.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_006",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Summer raids hit at dawn. I've doubled the morning watch.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_007",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Autumn raids hit harder. They're stockpiling for winter. So are we.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_008",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "weather": "RAIN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Muddy ground slows raiders. Slows us too. Maintain the paths.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_009",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Harvest Faire. I'll attend. Briefly. Someone has to watch the gate.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_010",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Cold steel, steady hands. Winter doesn't care about your comfort.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_011",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "weather": "SNOW",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Snow reveals tracks. Good for us. Post scouts at the treeline.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_012",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Remembrance Day. I remember every name. Every face.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_013",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "weather": "STORM",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Storms provide cover for raiders. All units on alert.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_014",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "weather": "FOG",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Visibility compromised. I want sentries at double intervals.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_015",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Those turrets need repositioning. Eastern flank is exposed.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_016",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "I've seen what happens when towns can't defend themselves. Not here.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_017",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Your machines are... adequate. Build more.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_018",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Militia drill at dawn. Your automatons should participate.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_019",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "The Marshal knows about us now. That changes everything.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_020",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Leera's scouting reports are useful. Don't tell her I said that.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_021",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Pip tried to join the militia today. I gave her a wooden sword. She was thrilled.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_022",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "I lost eleven soldiers in the Ashspine campaign. I remember every name.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_023",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Good work on the wall repairs. Solid engineering.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_024",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Stay alert, engineer. The quiet doesn't mean safety. It means waiting.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_sd_025",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Linden's optimism is... useful. Keeps morale up. Someone has to worry though.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_hm_02",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 2
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_harrow_milestone_2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Here. Military-grade maintenance kit. Keep your machines combat-ready.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_hm_04",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 4
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_harrow_milestone_4",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "You've earned my respect, engineer. That's not something I give easily.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_hm_06",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 6
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_harrow_milestone_6",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "I'm going to tell you something I've never told anyone. About Ashspine.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_hm_08",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 8
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_harrow_milestone_8",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "If the Marshal comes... I need you beside me. Not behind me. Beside me.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_hm_10",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 10
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_harrow_milestone_10",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "You're the best soldier who never enlisted. Coppervale's lucky to have you, Jack.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_spring_031",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "The alliance is good news. But alliances are only as strong as the weakest link. We need to be the strongest.",
          "portrait": "stern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_spring_032",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Janis knows her strategy. I'll give her that. Having a Council liaison changes our intelligence picture considerably.",
          "portrait": "grudging_respect"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_summer_033",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "The bunker confirmed what I suspected. The Marshal isn't a raider — he's a general. Different breed entirely.",
          "portrait": "grim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_summer_034",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "I've been drilling the militia harder. Some of them complain. They won't complain when the walls hold.",
          "portrait": "pragmatic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_autumn_035",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "He gave us a timeline. Good. Now we use every second of it. No wasted days, Jack.",
          "portrait": "focused"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_autumn_036",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "The allied forces are arriving. Good fighters. Need to integrate them into our defense grid without ego getting in the way.",
          "portrait": "professional"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y2_winter_037",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "This is what I trained for my whole life. Defending a home. Funny — took me sixty years to find one worth defending.",
          "portrait": "reflective"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y3_spring_038",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "The expedition to the Spire is the most dangerous mission we've attempted. I wish I was going with you. But someone has to hold Coppervale.",
          "portrait": "heavy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y3_summer_039",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Radio reports from the Scorchland offensive are good. We're hitting his supply lines hard. Keep pushing, Jack.",
          "portrait": "tactical"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y3_autumn_040",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "It's over. After all these years... it's actually over. I don't quite know what to do with myself.",
          "portrait": "lost"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y3_autumn_041",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "Maybe I'll teach. Train the next generation of defenders. God knows they'll need it — the world's still dangerous.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y3_winter_042",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "I've been a soldier all my life. But watching this town grow... I think I've found something worth more than any battle.",
          "portrait": "at_peace"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_harrow_y4_spring_043",
      "npc_id": "npc_harrow",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 4,
        "hearts_gte": 0,
        "story_flag": "flag_main_story_complete"
      },
      "priority": 11,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_harrow",
          "text": "The splinter raiders are nothing compared to the Marshal's army. We handle them. But I keep the watch sharp. Always.",
          "portrait": "vigilant"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}